- lib-modules-missing-docs (doc/js/README.md:61): `lib/database.js`,
  `lib/dbi.js` and `lib/describe-class.js` exist and are exported like
  any other JS module, but have no doc/js/*.md page - doc/js/README.md
  used to link to database.md/dbi.md/describe-class.md as if they
